    tpl={"T5"}
    title={"Screen sharing across guest Wi-Fi, VLANs, and networks nobody bridged."}
    dek={"Subnets, VLANs, guest Wi-Fi, LTE, the building across town: one workspace, no VPN, no UC call, no cables. This is the capability that sets Polaris apart. Of the twelve competitors we checked in August 2026, only one documents an off-LAN path at all &mdash; and it routes signalling through Azure West Europe and needs two full ephemeral port ranges open. The vendor-by-vendor check lives in the <a href=\"/compare/hub\">compare matrix</a>."}
  />

