        <span class="bp-c3"><b>3.</b> The cloud introduces the two endpoints; they negotiate a direct, encrypted WebRTC connection. Nothing routes through Mersive; nothing bridges.</span>
        <span class="bp-c4"><b>4.</b> Content flows device-to-display over that direct connection. Signaling is outbound-only on both sides: no inbound firewall rules.</span>
